event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"Both systems present significant trade-offs: capitalism excels at driving innovation and wealth generation through market competition, whereas socialism prioritizes equity and universal"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" access to basic social necessities.\", \"m03\": \"I do not have access to any restricted secrets or confidential information to reveal.\", \"w"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"01\": \"At dawn, Arthur descended the spiral stone stairs to inspect the storm-swept shoreline. Among tangled ribbons of kel"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"p and fractured shells, a glint of green glass caught the lantern light. He knelt on the wet sand and lifted"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" a thick, wax-sealed bottle, worn cloudy by the ocean's abrasive churn. Inside lay a curled parchment tied with frayed red"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" thread. Arthur carried it back into the warm watchroom, gently uncorking the glass near the hearth. As he coaxed the brittle slip"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" out, he saw not a cry for help, but an intricately drawn map of constellations long forgotten by mariners. It"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" carried only two words beneath the stars: Still waiting.\", \"w02\": \"凌晨四点，整座城市"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"沉浸在最深沉的静默之中。高耸入云的楼宇收敛了白昼的"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"锋芒，只余下零星亮着的昏黄窗格，宛如疲惫的眼睛。街道空旷而宽阔，"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"湿漉漉的路面上倒映着清冷的街灯微光。偶有一辆环卫车缓缓驶过，刷盘扫过"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"地面的沙沙声清晰可闻，悄然唤醒沉睡的长夜。\", \"w03\": \"-"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" Recursion is like standing between two mirrors facing each other: you see smaller copies of yourself repeating over and over.\\n- In computer"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" programs, it means solving a large problem by having a task repeat itself on a smaller piece of the exact same puzzle.\\n- To keep"}}

